  "releaseNotes": "v2.3.0-alpha.2\n* change function behavior: do not maintain internal status in SubscribeEx any more\n\nv2.3.0-alpha.1\n* Add more methods: PublishEx, SubscribeEx, GetHandlersCount, GetClientsCount\n\nv2.2.1\n* Expose low-level objects (IServer, IDatabase) from StackExchange.Redis lib\n* Add \"allowAdmin=true\" to connection string\n\nv2.1.2\nRestore back channel count to 20, otherwise up-level package would fail to assign new channels\n\nv2.1.1\n* Fix inconsistent dependency of Nai.Utils at build-time (2.4.0) and run-time (2.3.8)\n\nv2.1.0\n* Do not check TCP connectivity in constructor any more\n* Expose redis client/server events to be registered\n* Upgrade Nai.Utils from 2.2.1 to 2.3.8\n\nv2.0.5\nCheck TCP connectivity in constructor\n\nv2.0.3\nReference Nai.Utils.dll via the nuget package\n\nv2.0.2\nRead config to initialize channel names count\n\nv2.0.1\nMigrate from net472 to netstandard2.0\n\nv1.5.0\nAdd redis server ip and port to config (you don't have to use it)\n\nv1.4.1\nExpose ConfigManager, change default channels number from 10 to 20\n\nv1.3.1\nUpdate dependencies\n\nv1.3.0\nAdd list operation for redis implementation\n\nv1.2.0\nFirst release",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
